	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d11r0501_assistantw_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こんかいの　じっけんけっかは
ふつう　ね……▼
ねえ　きみ！　つくれた
キズぐすりを　あげるよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-19T09:34:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T13:46:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>今回の　実験結果は
普通ね……▼
ねえ　きみ！　つくれた
キズぐすりを　あげるよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-19T09:34:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T13:46:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・アイテム入手処理
　No017「キズぐすり」</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
