	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d11r0501_assistantw_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あしたも　あさっても　じっけん！
つづけることが　だいじ　なの！▽
よければ　けっかを　みにきてね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-16T02:40:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T13:46:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>明日も　明後日も　実験！
続けることが　大事なの！▽
よければ　結果を　みにきてね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-16T02:39:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T13:46:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・アイテム入手後
　日付が変わるまで繰り返し</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T13:46:37" />
		</CommentCell>
